{"articleNo":"106545","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=106545&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"♣ ♣ 2014년도 1학기 강의평가 실시","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.05.19","hit":"6803","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>2014학년도 1학기 강의평가 실시</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><!--StartFragment--></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;다음과 같이 1학기 강의평가를 실시하오니 많은 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><!--StartFragment--><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">【<font color=\"#0900ff\">학생 개인이 </font><font color=\"#0900ff\">강의</font></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">평가한 내용은 해당 교수는 절대 알 수 없으며,&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 익명성이 보장되고</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">평가 결과는 성적부</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">여에</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;영향을&nbsp;</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">미치지 않는</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;&nbsp;성적 확정 이후에 전산처리된 결과 값만 해당 교수</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">에게 공개 열람</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 됩</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">니다</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">】</span></p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. 평가 목적</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학생이 한 학기 동안 받은 교육에 대한 자신의 평가</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">교수는 강의에 대한 피드백 기회를 제공</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">교육의 품질을 향상</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;</span></p><!--StartFragment--><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">평가 활용 </span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" cla